  '<p class="gd-p">Plans change. You can ask for more days, ask to change dates, answer a change we suggest, or cancel, all from your booking.</p><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-extend-your-rental" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Extend your rental</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Extend</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Pick how long: <b class="gd-ui">1 hour</b>, <b class="gd-ui">3 hours</b>, <b class="gd-ui">1 day</b>, <b class="gd-ui">3 days</b>, <b class="gd-ui">1 week</b> or <b class="gd-ui">1 month</b>. Each shows the new return, the price with the regular price struck through, and what you save. An option the car cannot take is greyed out with the reason, and the page says until when the car is free.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Pay</b> to pay with your card on file. When the car is free it is approved at once and the page shows your new return. No card on file, or the card is declined? The secure payment page opens: enter a card there. Otherwise the request goes to our team, and once approved you pay on the same page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">For another date, open <b class="gd-ui">Another date and time</b>, choose it, press <b class="gd-ui">See the price</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Request extension</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/extend</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:960/552"><img src="/guides/img/renter-11-extend-desktop-957274cc.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="552"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:34.4%;top:62.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.1%;top:77.2%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Extending costs less than being late: a day or more is 5% off, and 1 or 3 hours are 10% off the late fee. Already past your return time and still have the car? You can still extend. It counts from your original return time, and the late charges stay owed until the extension is paid.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-ask-to-change-dates" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask to change dates</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change dates</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the new pickup and return, then press <b class="gd-ui">See the difference</b> to see what you would pay or get back.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change dates</b> to send it. Nothing changes until you agree to our answer.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/change</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:960/552"><img src="/guides/img/renter-12-change-desktop-09f6b563.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="552"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.1%;top:91.8%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-a-change-we-suggest" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A change we suggest</h2><p class="gd-p">Sometimes we need to change your booking, for example another car of the same class. You decide.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">You get an email, and your booking says &quot;We suggest a change to your booking&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Review and answer</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read what changes (before and after), the reason, the money and the time left to answer.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">To agree, press <b class="gd-ui">Accept and sign the amendment</b>, sign, then press <b class="gd-ui">Accept and sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Anything more to pay is charged to your Card on File. If the card is declined, press <b class="gd-ui">Pay and apply the change</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">To say no, press <b class="gd-ui">Decline this change</b>. Your booking stays as it was.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You have 48 hours to answer, and we send one reminder. CarmaCars signs the amendment at the moment you sign it, and the signed copy is saved under Documents. If the change costs less, the refund goes back to your card within 10 business days after the amendment is signed.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-cancel-a-booking" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Cancel a booking</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Cancel booking</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read What you get back. It shows the rule that applies and your refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the booking number to confirm (for example CC-10021), then press <b class="gd-ui">Cancel booking</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/cancel</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/renter-13-cancel-desktop-d0bb2c67.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:36.1%;top:67.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:95.8%;top:45.1%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Standard booking: when you cancel</th><th scope="col">Refund of what you paid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Within 24 hours of booking, and 48 hours or more before pickup</td><td>95% back</td></tr><tr><td>48 hours or more before pickup</td><td>75% back</td></tr><tr><td>24 to 48 hours before pickup</td><td>50% back</td></tr><tr><td>Less than 24 hours before pickup</td><td>No refund</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="gd-p">A Non-refundable booking gets no refund. The deposit is taken at pickup, so none is held when you cancel before it.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-messages-tolls-and-tickets" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Messages, tolls and tickets</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On a rental of 2 days or more we check in after the first day: &quot;How is the car?&quot; If anything is off, reply to the email or text, or call us.</li><li>Write to us about a booking at the bottom of its page: type in Your message and press Send.</li><li>Tolls and tickets are yours to pay, including Highway 407 ETR. If one reaches us, we pay it and charge the amount plus our fee to your Card on File, and email you a copy of the notice.</li><li>Running late? Extend in your booking, even after the return time while you still have the car, or call us at 289-312-5991. The late fee is 17.5% of the daily rate for each started hour (at least $25) after a 30 minute grace.</li><li>Before your return we remind you: the day before, about 3 hours before (with an Extend link) and at the return time. If the car is late we send a notice at 15 minutes and a final notice at 2 hours. No late notices between 10 pm and 7 am.</li><li>Something wrong with the car? While you have it, press <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> on your booking: it calls roadside help, or opens a message to us.</li><li>Someone else will drive too? Press <b class="gd-ui">Add a driver</b>: write their name in the message and we add them; they sign with their own link.</li></ul></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

Owners who list one or more cars with CarmaCars, whether Managed, Self-managed or Turo only. Your portal shows each car, its bookings, your invoices, statements and payouts, and every form to sign.

### What you need

- The email address you applied or were invited with
- Each car''s VIN, ownership permit and insurance details
- A Canadian bank account for your fees and payouts

## Your first sign-in

1. New to CarmaCars? Apply at `carmacars.ca/list-your-car`. Your account is made at the end of the application: open the email "Confirm your CarmaCars account" within 24 hours and its link opens your owner portal.
2. Invited by us? Open the invitation email within 24 hours, choose a password and press **Save the new password**.
3. Next time, go to `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, enter your Email and Password and press **Sign in**.
4. Forgot your password? Press **Forgot your password?** on the sign-in page and follow the email.
5. Rather use your phone? Press **Use my phone number instead** on the sign-in page, enter your mobile number and the 6-digit code we text you. Add and verify your number first under **Account** > **Profile**, Sign-in, so it opens your owner portal.

![](/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg "phone; size: 390 645; pins: 3 95.4 78.4")

> Good to know: Email links work for 24 hours, once. If a link has expired, the page it opens has **Send me a new link**.
', 'Start here', 'Who this is for and your first sign-in.',
  '### Who this guide is for

Owners who list one or more cars with CarmaCars, whether Managed, Self-managed or Turo only. Your portal shows each car, its bookings, your invoices, statements and payouts, and every form to sign.

### What you need

- The email address you applied or were invited with
- Each car''s VIN, ownership permit and insurance details
- A Canadian bank account for your fees and payouts

## Your first sign-in

1. New to CarmaCars? Apply at `carmacars.ca/list-your-car`. Your account is made at the end of the application: open the email "Confirm your CarmaCars account" within 24 hours and its link opens your owner portal.
2. Invited by us? Open the invitation email within 24 hours, choose a password and press **Save the new password**.
3. Next time, go to `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, enter your Email and Password and press **Sign in**.
4. Forgot your password? Press **Forgot your password?** on the sign-in page and follow the email.
5. Rather use your phone? Press **Use my phone number instead** on the sign-in page, enter your mobile number and the 6-digit code we text you. Add and verify your number first under **Account** > **Profile**, Sign-in, so it opens your owner portal.

![](/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg "phone; size: 390 645; pins: 3 95.4 78.4")

> Good to know: Email links work for 24 hours, once. If a link has expired, the page it opens has **Send me a new link**.

## Stuck on a page?

If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.',
  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">Owners who list one or more cars with CarmaCars, whether Managed, Self-managed or Turo only. Your portal shows each car, its bookings, your invoices, statements and payouts, and every form to sign.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>The email address you applied or were invited with</li><li>Each car&#39;s VIN, ownership permit and insurance details</li><li>A Canadian bank account for your fees and payouts</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">New to CarmaCars? Apply at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/list-your-car</span>. Your account is made at the end of the application: open the email &quot;Confirm your CarmaCars account&quot; within 24 hours and its link opens your owner portal.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Invited by us? Open the invitation email within 24 hours, choose a password and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Next time, go to <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span>, enter your Email and Password and press <b class="gd-ui">Sign in</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Forgot your password? Press <b class="gd-ui">Forgot your password?</b> on the sign-in page and follow the email.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Rather use your phone? Press <b class="gd-ui">Use my phone number instead</b> on the sign-in page, enter your mobile number and the 6-digit code we text you. Add and verify your number first under <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, Sign-in, so it opens your owner portal.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/645"><img src="/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="645"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:95.4%;top:78.4%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Email links work for 24 hours, once. If a link has expired, the page it opens has <b class="gd-ui">Send me a new link</b>.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-stuck-on-a-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Stuck on a page?</h2><p class="gd-p">If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks <b class="gd-ui">Need a hand with</b> the page. <b class="gd-ui">Open the guide section</b> opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); <b class="gd-ui">Back to what I was doing</b> closes it and everything you typed is still there. <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'notices-profile-and-leaving', 'chapter', 'for-partner-rental-companies', 'Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.

## Notifications

1. Account > Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.
2. Press **Mark as read** on one, or **Mark all as read**.

![](/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/owner/notifications; pins: 2 20.1 22.7")

## Your profile

1. Update your email, phone and address, then press Save.
2. On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.

![](/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 872; address: carmacars.ca/owner/profile; pins: 1 12.2 84.7, 2 73.4 21.2")

## Texts or email

On **Account** > **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.

## Take a car out of the program

You give 30 days'' notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.

1. Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.
2. Press **Give notice**. Add a Reason (optional).
3. Press **Give exit notice**. The car''s page then shows its exit date.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. **Send a test alert** shows one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days'' notice), then delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.', 'Notices, profile and leaving', 'Notifications, your profile and giving an exit notice.',
  'Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.

## Notifications

1. Account > Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.
2. Press **Mark as read** on one, or **Mark all as read**.

![](/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/owner/notifications; pins: 2 20.1 22.7")

## Your profile

1. Update your email, phone and address, then press Save.
2. On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.

![](/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 872; address: carmacars.ca/owner/profile; pins: 1 12.2 84.7, 2 73.4 21.2")

## Texts or email

On **Account** > **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.

## Take a car out of the program

You give 30 days'' notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.

1. Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.
2. Press **Give notice**. Add a Reason (optional).
3. Press **Give exit notice**. The car''s page then shows its exit date.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. **Send a test alert** shows one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press **Turn on**, or **Not now** (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers **Download the CarmaCars app** instead.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days'' notice), then delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.</p><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-notifications" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Notifications</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Account &gt; Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> on one, or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/notifications</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:20.1%;top:22.7%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Update your email, phone and address, then press Save.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/profile</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/872"><img src="/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="872"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.2%;top:84.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.4%;top:21.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-take-a-car-out-of-the-program" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Take a car out of the program</h2><p class="gd-p">You give 30 days&#39; notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give notice</b>. Add a Reason (optional).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give exit notice</b>. The car&#39;s page then shows its exit date.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> shows one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers <b class="gd-ui">Download the CarmaCars app</b> instead.</p><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days&#39; notice), then delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('admin', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

The CarmaCars Admin: the owner of the business, signed in as rent@carmacars.ca. Admin sees and changes everything, and can open any other portal as one of its people. Staff work in the staff portal instead.

### What you need

- The Admin email address: rent@carmacars.ca. Only that address can hold the Admin role (Admin > Settings > Admin access lists it)
- Access to that inbox (links work for 24 hours, once)
- A computer for most work. Admin also works on a phone, with the whole menu behind one Menu button

## Your first sign-in

1. First time? Go to `carmacars.ca/reset-password`, enter your Admin email and press **Send the link**.
2. Open the email "Reset your CarmaCars password" within 24 hours and press **Choose a new password**.
3. Type a New password of 8 characters or more and press **Save the new password**. You land in Admin.
4. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with that email and password.

![](/guides/img/public-11-reset-password-phone-f4497631.jpg "phone; size: 390 525; pins: 1 95.4 59.2")

> Good to know: A link that has expired or was already used opens "This link has expired" with **Send me a new link**. Invited by another Admin? The invitation email works the same way.
', 'Start here', 'Who this is for and your first sign-in.',
  '### Who this guide is for

The CarmaCars Admin: the owner of the business, signed in as rent@carmacars.ca. Admin sees and changes everything, and can open any other portal as one of its people. Staff work in the staff portal instead.

### What you need

- The Admin email address: rent@carmacars.ca. Only that address can hold the Admin role (Admin > Settings > Admin access lists it)
- Access to that inbox (links work for 24 hours, once)
- A computer for most work. Admin also works on a phone, with the whole menu behind one Menu button

## Your first sign-in

1. First time? Go to `carmacars.ca/reset-password`, enter your Admin email and press **Send the link**.
2. Open the email "Reset your CarmaCars password" within 24 hours and press **Choose a new password**.
3. Type a New password of 8 characters or more and press **Save the new password**. You land in Admin.
4. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with that email and password.

![](/guides/img/public-11-reset-password-phone-f4497631.jpg "phone; size: 390 525; pins: 1 95.4 59.2")

> Good to know: A link that has expired or was already used opens "This link has expired" with **Send me a new link**. Invited by another Admin? The invitation email works the same way.

## Stuck on a page?

If you work on a page for a few minutes without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the chapter for that page in a panel beside it (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Open the Academy lesson** opens the lesson in a new tab. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while someone pays or signs. You set the minutes and the errors under **Settings** > **Program settings** > **Stuck? help**, and **Where people get stuck** there lists the pages it showed on most in the last 30 days.',
