select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

Investors with an Investment Agreement with CarmaCars. Your portal shows each investment, what it has earned and paid, your monthly statements, and lets you send notices to us.

### What you need

- The invitation email from CarmaCars (investor accounts are by invitation only)
- Access to that inbox: the link works for 24 hours, once
- An authenticator app, if you choose two-step sign-in (recommended)

## Your first sign-in

1. Open the invitation email and press its link within 24 hours.
2. Choose a password of 8 characters or more and press **Save the new password**. You land on Home.
3. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, or use Investor sign in at the bottom of any page of carmacars.ca.
4. Forgot your password? Press **Forgot your password?** on the sign-in page.

![](/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg "phone; size: 390 645; pins: 3 95.4 78.4")

> Good to know: Link expired? The page it opens has **Send me a new link**.
', 'Start here', 'Who this is for and your first sign-in.',
  '### Who this guide is for

Investors with an Investment Agreement with CarmaCars. Your portal shows each investment, what it has earned and paid, your monthly statements, and lets you send notices to us.

### What you need

- The invitation email from CarmaCars (investor accounts are by invitation only)
- Access to that inbox: the link works for 24 hours, once
- An authenticator app, if you choose two-step sign-in (recommended)

## Your first sign-in

1. Open the invitation email and press its link within 24 hours.
2. Choose a password of 8 characters or more and press **Save the new password**. You land on Home.
3. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, or use Investor sign in at the bottom of any page of carmacars.ca.
4. Forgot your password? Press **Forgot your password?** on the sign-in page.

![](/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg "phone; size: 390 645; pins: 3 95.4 78.4")

> Good to know: Link expired? The page it opens has **Send me a new link**.

## Stuck on a page?

If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.',
  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">Investors with an Investment Agreement with CarmaCars. Your portal shows each investment, what it has earned and paid, your monthly statements, and lets you send notices to us.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>The invitation email from CarmaCars (investor accounts are by invitation only)</li><li>Access to that inbox: the link works for 24 hours, once</li><li>An authenticator app, if you choose two-step sign-in (recommended)</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the invitation email and press its link within 24 hours.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose a password of 8 characters or more and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>. You land on Home.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Next time, sign in at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span>, or use Investor sign in at the bottom of any page of carmacars.ca.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Forgot your password? Press <b class="gd-ui">Forgot your password?</b> on the sign-in page.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/645"><img src="/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="645"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:95.4%;top:78.4%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Link expired? The page it opens has <b class="gd-ui">Send me a new link</b>.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-stuck-on-a-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Stuck on a page?</h2><p class="gd-p">If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks <b class="gd-ui">Need a hand with</b> the page. <b class="gd-ui">Open the guide section</b> opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); <b class="gd-ui">Back to what I was doing</b> closes it and everything you typed is still there. <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.</p></section>');
